[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18553.55, "timestamp": "05:09:13", "text": "嗯，所以她不會有任何加班費。  好的，明白了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18557.55, "timestamp": "05:09:17", "text": "。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18569.99, "timestamp": "05:09:29", "text": "。所以，呃，她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18571.99, "timestamp": "05:09:31", "text": "可以在「嘿，星期六在哪裡？」上做這件事。星期天在哪裡？星期一。"}]